  "country": "PL",
  "description": "Months (1-12) in which each product appears on the 'Kalendarz sezonowości' wheel of produkty-tradycyjne.pl ('OWOCE I WARZYWA DOSTĘPNE W ...': fruit and vegetables available in that month). The wheel has one sector per month plus a central 'CAŁY ROK' (all year) circle; products in that circle are listed under all 12 months. The wheel does not distinguish fresh harvest from storage, and has no peak marking. Only products shown on the wheel are included; products not listed are not covered by the source.",
